{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be the avant garde DJ!</h2><br>Add 340 Artsy art themed AI visuals to AI-VJ, from across 12 different styles!<br><br>Bring beauty to the dancing masses!<br><br>These visuals are pre-generated for optimum performance, carefully selected and manually tweaked for artistic quality, by an experienced DJ<br><br>The visuals are recorded at 60fps, which is double the normal video framerate, to ensure smooth visuals at every BPM. The total unique runtime of all visuals together is over 40 minutes. With some duplicate plays that's standard practice in VJ sets, this package is more than enough for a two hour long DJ set<br><br>After installing the DLC you can add these visuals to your deck through the &quot;Visuals DLCs&quot; top menu<br><br>Part of the Real Series: Using the latest AI for realistic imagery and movements!<br><br>(We're also happy to let you know that these visuals were created using green energy)","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735540?t=1755765241","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735540?t=1755765241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735540/94b8e9ae48ae4c0d91d1aca6c31d3adb9e138048/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755765241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735540/94b8e9ae48ae4c0d91d1aca6c31d3adb9e138048/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755765241","categories":[{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be the avant garde DJ!</h2><br>Add 340 Artsy art themed AI visuals to AI-VJ, from across 12 different styles!<br><br>Bring beauty to the dancing masses!<br><br>These visuals are pre-generated for optimum performance, carefully selected and manually tweaked for artistic quality, by an experienced DJ<br><